# Coverage Map

> This is the English translation of [coverage.md.template](./coverage.md.template). The Chinese version is the source of truth.
>
> This file is the workspace coverage source of truth. The `## Coverage` table lists researched companies; `coverage-monitor` consumes it for daily briefs and intraday alerts. The `## Focus` section (top) is the research lens — read by email-intelligence, candidate-screener and general research; research-journal updates it only on earned change.

## Focus

