### Maintenance Rule

- Email Intelligence, candidate screening and general research read this section as the screening lens; the user's explicit request for this round always takes precedence.
- Only append a Research Feedback row when completed and saved research truly changes long-term assumptions, medium-term narrative, current facts or selection direction — and sync the corresponding content above.
- Do not record daily todo, positions, trade state, raw ideas or per-news items.

## Coverage Contract

| Field | Values | Contract |
|---|---|---|
| Coverage | Core / Building / Radar | Core = sustained core workstream; Building = company-level coverage started; Radar = tracked candidate |
| Monitor | Core / Daily | Core = daily company news + movers + industry tape; Daily = daily quote scan + industry tape, company news only on mover/trigger |

